---
import PolicyPage from '../components/PolicyPage.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site.js';
---

<PolicyPage title="Cancellation & Refunds" description="ApiCare's cancellation, return and refund policy." updated="2 October 2026">
  <h2>Cancelling an order</h2>
  <p>
    You can cancel any order before it is dispatched for a full refund. Email
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or WhatsApp {site.phone} with your order reference
    (it starts with APC-).
  </p>

  <h2>Returns</h2>
  <p>
    Honey is a food product, so we cannot accept returns of opened jars or change-of-mind returns once an order has
    been dispatched.
  </p>

  <h2>Damaged, leaking or wrong items</h2>
  <p>
    If your jar arrives broken, leaking, or is not what you ordered, tell us within 48 hours of delivery with a photo
    of the jar and the packaging. We will send a replacement or give you a full refund. You do not need to send the
    jar back.
  </p>

  <h2>How refunds are paid</h2>
  <p>
    Refunds go back to the original payment method (UPI, card or netbanking) through Razorpay. We start the refund
    within 2 business days of approving it; your bank usually takes a further 5–7 business days to show it.
  </p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or call / WhatsApp {site.phone}.</p>
</PolicyPage>
